The sounds in Media/*.ogg were synthesized for this project with ffmpeg and are
covered by this project's license. The voice callouts in Media/Voice/ were
rendered with the Microsoft speech voices David, Zira and Mark built into Windows
(tools/generate_voices.ps1). Media/Icon.tga is this project's own logo
(docs/images/logo.svg in the repository), also covered by its license.

The cast-target highlight technique (PlayerIsSpellTarget fed to
Region:SetAlphaFromBoolean) follows Blizzard's documented 12.x API and is also
used by sArena Reloaded (https://github.com/Bodify/sArena_Reloaded); no code
from sArena Reloaded is included.
